        "low": null,
        "high": 55.97,
        "metric": "net_exposure",
        "unit": "% of baseline route value",
        "basis": "Upper bound only: 55.97% is the no-substitution scenario (the full route value decline). Substitution is UNKNOWN (substitution is reported but no trade series measures it), so no lower bound is supported.",
